#: qps.C:195
msgid ""
" - A Visual Process Manager (KDE Version)\n"
"\n"
"Š 1997 Mattias Engdegĺrd (f91-men@nada.kth.se)\n"
"Š 1998 Mario Weilguni (mweilguni@kde.org)\n"
"\n"
"kpm is the KDE version of qps, written by Matthias\n"
"Engdegĺrd. The port to KDE was done by Mario\n"
"Weilguni. If you are interested on the original\n"
"qps, you can find it at the following location:\n"
"    ftp://sunsite.unc.edu/pub/linux/system/status\n"
"\n"
"This program is published under the GNU General\n"
"Public License (GNU GPL). See the file COPYING\n"
"for details about this."
msgstr ""
" - Vizualni upravljalnik procesov (KDE verzija)\n"
"\n"
"(C) 1997 Mattias Engdegird (f91-men@nada.kth.se)\n"
"(C) 1998 Mario Weilguni (mweilguni@kde.org)\n"
"\n"
"kpm je KDE verzija qps, ki jo je napisal Matthias\n"
"Engdegird. Prenos na KDE je naredil Mario Weilguni.\n"
"Če vas zanima originalen qps, ga lahko najdete na:\n"
"   ftp://sunsite.unc.edu/pub/linux/system/status\n"
"\n"
"Ta program je objavljen pod licenco GNU General\n"
"Public License (GNU GPL). Za več podrobnosti si\n"
"preberite datoteko COPYING."

